{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825034594,"sessionID":"ses_f461eb89fffeglVev82zxa58vo","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e2a88f001hJymkbQvrvel8L","sessionID":"ses_f461eb89fffeglVev82zxa58vo","messageID":"msg_0b9e2a136001fNfYSDSUAaAzcN","type":"tool","id":"call_00_zyMdPuJz6S5JsdbKW74l8420","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"sed -n '3380,3400p' /tmp/opencode/petsmart/filing.txt; echo \"-----\"; sed -n '15390,15415p' /tmp/opencode/petsmart/filing.txt"},"output":"​\n\nMay 2011\n\n​\n\n​\n\nJo-Ann Stores, Inc.\n\n​\n\n​\n\nLeonard Green & Partners, L.P.\n\n​\n\n​\n\nDecember 2010\n-----\nTo Parent or Merger Sub:\n\nArgos Holdings Inc.\nc/o BC Partners, Inc.\n667 Madison Avenue, 19th Floor\nNew York, NY 10065\nFacsimile: (212) 891-2899\nEmail: Raymond.Svider@bcpartners.com\nAttention: Raymond Svider\n\nwith a copy to:\n\nSimpson Thacher and Bartlett LLP\n425 Lexington Avenue\nNew York, NY 10017\nFacsimile: (212) 455-2502\nEmail: rsymons@stblaw.com\nAttention: Ryerson Symons\n\nTo the Company:\n\nPetSmart, Inc.\n19601 N. 27th Avenue\nPhoenix, AZ 85027\nEmail: pdodson@ssg.petsmart.com\nAttention: Paulette Dodson\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"​\n\nMay 2011\n\n​\n\n​\n\nJo-Ann Stores, Inc.\n\n​\n\n​\n\nLeonard Green & Partners, L.P.\n\n​\n\n​\n\nDecember 2010\n-----\nTo Parent or Merger Sub:\n\nArgos Holdings Inc.\nc/o BC Partners, Inc.\n667 Madison Avenue, 19th Floor\nNew York, NY 10065\nFacsimile: (212) 891-2899\nEmail: Raymond.Svider@bcpartners.com\nAttention: Raymond Svider\n\nwith a copy to:\n\nSimpson Thacher and Bartlett LLP\n425 Lexington Avenue\nNew York, NY 10017\nFacsimile: (212) 455-2502\nEmail: rsymons@stblaw.com\nAttention: Ryerson Symons\n\nTo the Company:\n\nPetSmart, Inc.\n19601 N. 27th Avenue\nPhoenix, AZ 85027\nEmail: pdodson@ssg.petsmart.com\nAttention: Paulette Dodson\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCal